---
import MemoLayout from '../layouts/MemoLayout.astro';
---

<MemoLayout
  title="Fleetscope — Company Memo (Sample)"
  description="A fictional example of what a Company Memo looks like as a private webpage."
>
  <div class="frame">
    <div class="chrome">
      <span class="chrome-tag">FLEETSCOPE &middot; COMPANY MEMO</span>
      <a class="chrome-back" href="/">miketrounce.com &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <main class="doc">
      <div class="banner">
        Sample document for illustration only. Fleetscope, Northwind Logistics, and every figure
        below are invented &mdash; this is not a real company. Last updated 14 July 2026.
      </div>

      <h1 class="title">Fleetscope &mdash; Company Memo</h1>

      <section>
        <span class="kicker">Overview</span>
        <h2>Route-optimisation software for regional fleets</h2>
        <p>Fleetscope builds route-optimisation and fleet-scheduling software for regional trucking and delivery operators.</p>
        <table class="stat-table">
          <tr><th>Founded</th><td>Early 2024</td></tr>
          <tr><th>HQ</th><td>Bristol, UK</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Team</th><td>4 <span class="sub">Sam (CEO), 1 engineer, 1 part-time ops, 1 contractor (onboarding)</span></td></tr>
        </table>
      </section>

      <section>
        <span class="kicker">Product</span>
        <h2>Live, onboarding still hands-on</h2>
        <table class="stat-table">
          <tr><th>Status</th><td>Live <span class="sub">in production since Q3 2025</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th>Onboarding</th><td>Hands-on <span class="sub">self-serve planned, not yet built</span></td></tr>
        </table>
      </section>

      <section>
        <span class="kicker">Customers &amp; traction</span>
        <h2>Two paying customers, one pilot, one LOI</h2>
        <table class="data-table">
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Customer</th><th>Status</th><th>Detail</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Regional parcel courier</td><td>Paying</td><td>9 months</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Produce distributor</td><td>Paying</td><td>4 months</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Northwind Logistics</td><td>Paid pilot</td><td>12 vehicles, started Mar 2026<sup>*</sup></td></tr>
            <tr><td>Prospect (unnamed)</td><td>LOI signed</td><td>Not yet paying</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p class="table-note"><sup>*</sup> Full fleet rollout (~80 vehicles) has been discussed as a shared goal, but is not signed or scheduled. <em>(Earlier drafts of this memo described Northwind more loosely as &ldquo;a customer&hellip; rolling out across their whole fleet&rdquo; &mdash; corrected after the pilot&rsquo;s actual scope was confirmed directly with Sam. See change log.)</em></p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <span class="kicker">Financials</span>
        <h2>&pound;62k ARR, no institutional money yet</h2>
        <table class="stat-table">
          <tr><th>ARR</th><td>&pound;62,000 <span class="sub">as of June 2026</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th>Funding raised</th><td>&pound;280,000 <span class="sub">all from Sam&rsquo;s own network &mdash; no institutional investment yet</span></td></tr>
          <tr><th>Runway</th><td>~7 months <span class="sub">at current burn</span></td></tr>
        </table>
      </section>

      <section>
        <span class="kicker">What&rsquo;s being raised</span>
        <h2>&pound;1.2M seed</h2>
        <table class="stat-table">
          <tr><th>Raising</th><td>&pound;1.2M seed</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Use of funds</th><td>First dedicated sales hire; extend runway to 18 months; build out self-serve onboarding</td></tr>
        </table>
      </section>

      <section>
        <span class="kicker">Strategy &mdash; noted change</span>
        <h2>Enterprise-first, then quietly SMB-first</h2>
        <table class="data-table">
          <thead>
            <tr><th></th><th>Earlier &mdash; May 2026 session</th><th>Current &mdash; July 2026 session</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Go-to-market</td><td>Enterprise-first &mdash; Sam personally runs every sales conversation</td><td>SMB-first, self-serve &mdash; enterprise treated as a later-stage effort</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p class="table-note">This shift wasn&rsquo;t flagged by Sam as a change in direction &mdash; it came up naturally across two separate conversations. It&rsquo;s noted here rather than silently overwritten, since it&rsquo;s the kind of thing worth asking about directly.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <span class="kicker">Open, not yet verified</span>
        <h2>Two things still being confirmed</h2>
        <ul class="doc-list">
          <li>Exact split of the &pound;280,000 raised &mdash; how much came from Sam&rsquo;s own money versus outside angels &mdash; still being confirmed.</li>
          <li>Whether the produce distributor contract includes a renewal clause or is month-to-month.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <span class="kicker">Change log</span>
        <h2>How this document got here</h2>
        <ul class="doc-list changelog">
          <li><span class="doc-date">2026-05-12</span> First draft, from session 1. Company overview, product, and team.</li>
          <li><span class="doc-date">2026-06-03</span> Financials and funding history added, from session 3.</li>
          <li><span class="doc-date">2026-06-24</span> Northwind Logistics entry corrected: originally recorded as &ldquo;a customer&hellip; rolling out across their whole fleet,&rdquo; revised to reflect the actual signed pilot scope (12 vehicles) after cross-checking with Sam.</li>
          <li><span class="doc-date">2026-07-14</span> Go-to-market strategy shift noted (enterprise-first &rarr; SMB-first).</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <p class="footlink"><a href="https://github.com/Mike-Trounce-Organisation/company-memo-example/blob/main/fleetscope-company-memo-sample.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See this same document as a raw Markdown file &rarr;</a></p>
    </main>
  </div>
</MemoLayout>

<style>
  .frame { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 16px 60px; }

  .chrome {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding: 0 4px 14px;
  }
  .chrome-tag {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', 'Cascadia Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #6B7280;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .chrome-back {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #8B93A1;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .chrome-back:hover { color: #4F46E5; }

  .doc {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid #E3E6EB;
    border-radius: 14px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(20, 22, 26, 0.04), 0 24px 48px -32px rgba(20, 22, 26, 0.22);
    padding: 40px clamp(22px, 5vw, 56px) 56px;
  }

  .banner {
    padding: 13px 16px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border-left: 3px solid #4F46E5;
    background: #F5F6FA;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: #4B5563;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .title {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    color: #14161A;
  }

  section { padding: 26px 0; border-top: 1px solid #E9EAED; }
  section:first-of-type { border-top: none; padding-top: 6px; }

  .kicker {
    display: block;
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', 'Cascadia Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #9199A6;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  section h2 { font-size: 1.18rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px; color: #14161A; }
  section p { color: #4B5563; font-size: 1rem; max-width: 62ch; margin: 0; }

  .doc-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 11px; max-width: 62ch; }
  .doc-list li { font-size: 1rem; color: #4B5563; padding-left: 16px; position: relative; }
  .doc-list li::before { content: '\2013'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #9199A6; }
  .doc-list strong { color: #14161A; font-weight: 600; }
  .changelog li { padding-left: 0; }
  .changelog li::before { content: none; }
  .doc-date {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', 'Cascadia Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #14161A;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  /* ---- key/value stat table ---- */
  .stat-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 14px 0 0; max-width: 62ch; }
  .stat-table tr { border-top: 1px solid #E9EAED; }
  .stat-table tr:first-child { border-top: none; }
  .stat-table th, .stat-table td { padding: 10px 0; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; font-weight: 400; }
  .stat-table th {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', 'Cascadia Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #9199A6;
    font-weight: 600;
    width: 34%;
    padding-right: 16px;
  }
  .stat-table td { font-size: 1.02rem; color: #14161A; font-weight: 600; }
  .stat-table td .sub { display: block; font-weight: 400; color: #6B7280; font-size: 0.88rem; margin-top: 2px; }

  /* ---- multi-column data table ---- */
  .data-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 14px 0 0; }
  .data-table th, .data-table td { padding: 10px 14px 10px 0; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
  .data-table thead th {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', 'Cascadia Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #9199A6;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #DDE0E5;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .data-table tbody td { font-size: 0.96rem; color: #33363D; border-top: 1px solid #EEF0F3; }
  .data-table tbody tr:first-child td { border-top: none; }
  .data-table tbody td:first-child { font-weight: 600; color: #14161A; }
  .data-table sup { color: #4F46E5; font-weight: 700; }

  .table-note { color: #6B7280; font-size: 0.88rem; max-width: 62ch; margin: 14px 0 0; }
  .table-note em { font-style: italic; }

  .footlink { margin-top: 34px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .footlink a { text-decoration: none; }
  .footlink a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
